(3340920, 463356, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pretty funky image. Looks heavily neat imaged with the softness and halo, but upon looking at it longer the halo works for this. It seems to give some definition on the subjects of the image that may have just been lost with it all being as dark as it is. Overall this has a surreal feel to it. Not sure how itwill score overall but I am giving it a 7 for now.</td>', 'Pretty funky image. Looks heavily neat imaged with the softness and halo, but upon looking at it longer the halo works for this. It seems to give some definition on the subjects of the image that may have just been lost with it all being as dark as it is. Overall this has a surreal feel to it. Not sure how itwill score overall but I am giving it a 7 for now.', '2007-02-07 18:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
