(3342929, 464819, 49109, '<td valign="top">don''t agree, this is the best advertising for a church or religion I''ve ever seen</td>', 'don''t agree, this is the best advertising for a church or religion I''ve ever seen', '2007-02-08 04:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343002, 464765, 48954, '<td valign="top">This must be Irene ;)<br/> <br/>These tend to be DPC safe shots. You should to fine. I must admit i''m not a great fan. It''s a good shot but the composition is a little off and your first submission out does this BIG TIME!<br/> <br/>(How embarassing would it be if this wasn''t Irene''s submission....yeeesh)</td>', 'This must be Irene ;) These tend to be DPC safe shots. You should to fine. I must admit i''m not a great fan. It''s a good shot but the composition is a little off and your first submission out does this BIG TIME! (How embarassing would it be if this wasn''t Irene''s submission....yeeesh)', '2007-02-08 05:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343005, 463425, 48954, '<td valign="top">great stuff! Love it</td>', 'great stuff! Love it', '2007-02-08 05:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
