(3343260, 463752, 71793, '<td valign="top">You captured great emotion from this baby.  I am a mother of a 13 month old and she has her moments of major melt down also.</td>', 'You captured great emotion from this baby.  I am a mother of a 13 month old and she has her moments of major melt down also.', '2007-02-08 08:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343262, 464021, 71793, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2007-02-08 08:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343263, 462602, 71793, '<td valign="top">lighting is very good.</td>', 'lighting is very good.', '2007-02-08 08:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343264, 464746, 57981, '<td valign="top">technically it needs work ... i think the lighting is a bit off ... more detail is needed on the asthma apparatus and perhaps a black shirt to prevent the blown highlights.<br/> <br/>but i think the composition is good ... use of the frame is very, very good. the tube comes in from the bottom corner very nicely and the negative space works well to draw attention to the subject. <br/> <br/>to be honest, i think you''ve under processed this shot because it''s a self portrait ... i think that comes from a reluctance or fear to express yourself. adding a little more light and sharpness to the shot would make the world of difference.<br/> <br/>overall, a very good shot ... and quite an impact! 8!</td>', 'technically it needs work ... i think the lighting is a bit off ... more detail is needed on the asthma apparatus and perhaps a black shirt to prevent the blown highlights. but i think the composition is good ... use of the frame is very, very good. the tube comes in from the bottom corner very nicely and the negative space works well to draw attention to the subject.  to be honest, i think you''ve under processed this shot because it''s a self portrait ... i think that comes from a reluctance or fear to express yourself. adding a little more light and sharpness to the shot would make the world of difference. overall, a very good shot ... and quite an impact! 8!', '2007-02-08 08:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3343266, 463261, 71793, '<td valign="top">I really liked this black and white picture.</td>', 'I really liked this black and white picture.', '2007-02-08 08:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
