(3349357, 464961, 23484, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the "Bad" part of it other than it is in bad shape. However, I really like the shot. I think the colors of the sky and the buildings are great.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the "Bad" part of it other than it is in bad shape. However, I really like the shot. I think the colors of the sky and the buildings are great.', '2007-02-09 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349446, 463838, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good shot but why not color? She has great eyes and I think the color would have made this shot special.</td>', 'Good shot but why not color? She has great eyes and I think the color would have made this shot special.', '2007-02-09 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349797, 464872, 72774, '<td valign="top">Good concept, the blood seems a bit too fake (maybe it was meant to be for humor).</td>', 'Good concept, the blood seems a bit too fake (maybe it was meant to be for humor).', '2007-02-10 01:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349799, 464901, 72774, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Razer sharp focus on the models, I''d almost prefer a little more fill light, but very striking image.</td>', 'Nice.  Razer sharp focus on the models, I''d almost prefer a little more fill light, but very striking image.', '2007-02-10 01:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349801, 464898, 72774, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh, that''s got to count for something :)</td>', 'Made me laugh, that''s got to count for something :)', '2007-02-10 01:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349802, 464742, 72774, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I wish (it was legal) you could have removed the extra weather vanes, vetry distracting, taking up space in the composition.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I wish (it was legal) you could have removed the extra weather vanes, vetry distracting, taking up space in the composition.', '2007-02-10 01:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349805, 465058, 72774, '<td valign="top">It''d definitely make a good stock photo!</td>', 'It''d definitely make a good stock photo!', '2007-02-10 01:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349806, 464034, 72774, '<td valign="top">Good strong image, but it just seems like everything is a bit too clean.  With some grunge on the model and the bowl, it might make a bit more sense.</td>', 'Good strong image, but it just seems like everything is a bit too clean.  With some grunge on the model and the bowl, it might make a bit more sense.', '2007-02-10 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349908, 464635, 67258, '<td valign="top">Yep, this is definitely bad!  I have a real problem scoring this one - it is bad in every single respect from composition through to focus, and therefore fits the challenge perfectly (the plastic rose is an especially nice touch), and so I should score high, but I just can''t bring myself to.  Wait, the exposure is actually pretty good, phew - I can safely justify knocking a couple of points off!</td>', 'Yep, this is definitely bad!  I have a real problem scoring this one - it is bad in every single respect from composition through to focus, and therefore fits the challenge perfectly (the plastic rose is an especially nice touch), and so I should score high, but I just can''t bring myself to.  Wait, the exposure is actually pretty good, phew - I can safely justify knocking a couple of points off!', '2007-02-10 04:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3349909, 464951, 67258, '<td valign="top">The blood is a bit over-done, but that smug reflection in the mirror is so creepy that it way makes up for it!  Nice one!</td>', 'The blood is a bit over-done, but that smug reflection in the mirror is so creepy that it way makes up for it!  Nice one!', '2007-02-10 04:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
