(3366668, 464952, 50695, '<td valign="top">Kelly, the DNMC voters thought you were *good* looking, so don''t feel bad about that. <br/> <br/>This was a subtle, bummed sort of sadness, the kind we feel every day. DPC voters want the person crouched in the corner chiaroscuroly, preferably naked. oh wait, that was the nude challenge. anyway, they like big emotion. they''ve got the popcorn out and they think they''re at the movies... and not a good movie, either.</td>', 'Kelly, the DNMC voters thought you were *good* looking, so don''t feel bad about that.  This was a subtle, bummed sort of sadness, the kind we feel every day. DPC voters want the person crouched in the corner chiaroscuroly, preferably naked. oh wait, that was the nude challenge. anyway, they like big emotion. they''ve got the popcorn out and they think they''re at the movies... and not a good movie, either.', '2007-02-14 17:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
