(3367411, 465104, 66384, '<td valign="top">Something must be wrong with me. I gave this an 8, for two reasons: first I think it really is an abomination, and second I really like it. The clincher for the abomination part is the "preppy" pink and green border. What I like the best is the vibrant color of the image. Really cheers me up to see it.</td>', 'Something must be wrong with me. I gave this an 8, for two reasons: first I think it really is an abomination, and second I really like it. The clincher for the abomination part is the "preppy" pink and green border. What I like the best is the vibrant color of the image. Really cheers me up to see it.', '2007-02-14 20:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
