(3367474, 464746, 31399, '<td valign="top">nice profile there girlie ;-)<br/> <br/>lighting is nice.  not sure about the shirt showing... I kinda like this with shoulder cropped out...but also agree tube should be in.  I TOTALLY get your take on "bad" in this shot and agree...we''ve a neb at home also.<br/> <br/>congrats on nice score and emotive shot...</td>', 'nice profile there girlie ;-) lighting is nice.  not sure about the shirt showing... I kinda like this with shoulder cropped out...but also agree tube should be in.  I TOTALLY get your take on "bad" in this shot and agree...we''ve a neb at home also. congrats on nice score and emotive shot...', '2007-02-14 20:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3367479, 464821, 7778, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by raish:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s just a page of a catalogue. ''Bad'' being a word for ''bath''/''bathroom''/''bathe'' and so on in Scandinavian languages. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>as in German.</td>', 'Originally posted by raish: It''s just a page of a catalogue. ''Bad'' being a word for ''bath''/''bathroom''/''bathe'' and so on in Scandinavian languages.   as in German.', '2007-02-14 20:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3367509, 464821, 62318, '<td valign="top">Raish, I like the message here. Yes it works for the challenge. However, I think this is the other extreme. This image is more about the challenge than photography. It''s just a picture of an Ad, as such it is the same as a Xerox. <br/> <br/>Unless you did do some "post" or "setup" here. I just don''t see it, there aren''t any details so I am just left with my initial opinion.<br/> <br/>Now if this is a work in photography, then it is truly a work of art, reminiscent of Warhol. Put little tid bits that look like pop art, but still make it a photo. <br/> <br/>Thing is I gave you a "5" for the concept alone. It would be interesting to see if you could stage this in real life with an added border, then you would have gotten a 10 from me.</td>', 'Raish, I like the message here. Yes it works for the challenge. However, I think this is the other extreme. This image is more about the challenge than photography. It''s just a picture of an Ad, as such it is the same as a Xerox.  Unless you did do some "post" or "setup" here. I just don''t see it, there aren''t any details so I am just left with my initial opinion. Now if this is a work in photography, then it is truly a work of art, reminiscent of Warhol. Put little tid bits that look like pop art, but still make it a photo.  Thing is I gave you a "5" for the concept alone. It would be interesting to see if you could stage this in real life with an added border, then you would have gotten a 10 from me.', '2007-02-14 20:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3367523, 465015, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great picture. I like the exposure and the angle. The rain drops make the image. I think it is just missing a central subject to tie it together, like some person running in front of your car. That would have made the image for me, however this image is still deserving of a higher score.</td>', 'I think this is a great picture. I like the exposure and the angle. The rain drops make the image. I think it is just missing a central subject to tie it together, like some person running in front of your car. That would have made the image for me, however this image is still deserving of a higher score.', '2007-02-14 20:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3367580, 464806, 3214, '<td valign="top">Narrow depth of field but in focus--but more depth of field would have raised your score from me, I gave it a 6 because I liked the composition and the story which aptly hit the theme.</td>', 'Narrow depth of field but in focus--but more depth of field would have raised your score from me, I gave it a 6 because I liked the composition and the story which aptly hit the theme.', '2007-02-14 21:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
