(3369070, 464952, 59029, '<td valign="top">I already commented on pic during challenge, gave it a 5. I do agree that the light on the hand is distracting.  Cheer up though, I got *booted* around for my Good shot, in which - guess what - I got called for both DNMC and grayish light!  Just keep shooting!</td>', 'I already commented on pic during challenge, gave it a 5. I do agree that the light on the hand is distracting.  Cheer up though, I got *booted* around for my Good shot, in which - guess what - I got called for both DNMC and grayish light!  Just keep shooting!', '2007-02-15 11:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3369074, 464821, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I actually wondered if anyone would pick up on the alternate meanings of the word ''bad'' in other languages when I first saw this challenge.<br/>I like the idea, but feel you needed to add something to give it the feeling of being your own, versus a photo of an Ikea ad. Still, there is something captivating about it. I didn''t vote but probably would have given you a 6, as it is refreshingly different.</td>', 'Interesting. I actually wondered if anyone would pick up on the alternate meanings of the word ''bad'' in other languages when I first saw this challenge.I like the idea, but feel you needed to add something to give it the feeling of being your own, versus a photo of an Ikea ad. Still, there is something captivating about it. I didn''t vote but probably would have given you a 6, as it is refreshingly different.', '2007-02-15 11:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3369075, 463425, 59029, '<td valign="top">I love the cheekiness in this picture.  Great work!</td>', 'I love the cheekiness in this picture.  Great work!', '2007-02-15 11:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3369429, 464678, 39850, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote in this Challenge, but like the concept.  As for your request for suggestions on the smoke, no expert, but would suggest faster shutter speed (can''t see what you used) and more light play.  Trying to keep a low ISO as well to minimize the grain.  The few times I''ve tried to capture it I find that natural sunlight works best.  Perhaps this image would have had a more dramatic effect with a more unusual angle/perspective.  Would have been good to see the ''pants'' too - if he has any.</td>', 'Didn''t vote in this Challenge, but like the concept.  As for your request for suggestions on the smoke, no expert, but would suggest faster shutter speed (can''t see what you used) and more light play.  Trying to keep a low ISO as well to minimize the grain.  The few times I''ve tried to capture it I find that natural sunlight works best.  Perhaps this image would have had a more dramatic effect with a more unusual angle/perspective.  Would have been good to see the ''pants'' too - if he has any.', '2007-02-15 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370209, 462721, 66597, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in these challenges, as I was leaving on my vacation, so this is the first time to see this photo. I can''t evaluate it as a chess player, since I don''t play, so will attempt to assess on photographic merits alone.<br/> <br/>First, I will say good white balance and excellent tonal range. You have the whole spectrum covered, which makes for a much better shot. The lighting seems solid, and the composition is fine (though the perspective is a bit skewed from above).<br/> <br/>I noticed almost all of your comments are from chess players :-) Maybe I should take up the game, and then I would understand better why this is bad.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-15 20:47:12.</i></td>', 'I didn''t vote in these challenges, as I was leaving on my vacation, so this is the first time to see this photo. I can''t evaluate it as a chess player, since I don''t play, so will attempt to assess on photographic merits alone. First, I will say good white balance and excellent tonal range. You have the whole spectrum covered, which makes for a much better shot. The lighting seems solid, and the composition is fine (though the perspective is a bit skewed from above). I noticed almost all of your comments are from chess players :-) Maybe I should take up the game, and then I would understand better why this is bad.', '2007-02-15 16:43:55.000000', '2007-02-15 20:47:12.000000', 0),
(3370534, 463728, 42013, '<td valign="top">You continue to delight. Congrats!</td>', 'You continue to delight. Congrats!', '2007-02-15 18:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
