(3370785, 464052, 66597, '<td valign="top">I knew you lived in Seattle the moment I saw this photo - I lived there right out of college for a couple years. Since you are already aware of the techical issues of your photo (hand-held at 1/6? - can''t believe it is this sharp, actually) I won''t elaborate too much. I suspect you mainly took this for fun, and it did fit the challenge very well. Looking forward to seeing further photos of this guy - next time with a tripod :-)</td>', 'I knew you lived in Seattle the moment I saw this photo - I lived there right out of college for a couple years. Since you are already aware of the techical issues of your photo (hand-held at 1/6? - can''t believe it is this sharp, actually) I won''t elaborate too much. I suspect you mainly took this for fun, and it did fit the challenge very well. Looking forward to seeing further photos of this guy - next time with a tripod :-)', '2007-02-15 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370796, 465015, 66597, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I find this photo very interesting. I would have given it decent marks had I voted (sorry!) I really like the way the lights on the car in front seem to be melting in an almost Dali-esque fashion. Mainly I think it is a good photo because the eye is instantly drawn to the brightest area (the "melty" lights) and then have a chance to take everything in. Not a very DPC-friendly photo, but some of my favorites aren''t frankly very DPC-friendly. Great job.</td>', 'Ooooh, I find this photo very interesting. I would have given it decent marks had I voted (sorry!) I really like the way the lights on the car in front seem to be melting in an almost Dali-esque fashion. Mainly I think it is a good photo because the eye is instantly drawn to the brightest area (the "melty" lights) and then have a chance to take everything in. Not a very DPC-friendly photo, but some of my favorites aren''t frankly very DPC-friendly. Great job.', '2007-02-15 19:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370808, 464434, 66597, '<td valign="top">Hee hee, gave me an instant chuckle. Fortunately, I''ve never had this happen. Maybe because I don''t have kids :-)<br/>It doesn''t look like you took too much time to set the shot up - has a candid look (not necessarily a bad thing, especially given that the action is naturally a spontaneous one). I do think a fill flash on your son''s face or directional light highlighting his features would have bumped you up a bit. I also find the gargabe can a little distracting in the front.<br/>Overall very cute, though. <br/></td>', 'Hee hee, gave me an instant chuckle. Fortunately, I''ve never had this happen. Maybe because I don''t have kids :-)It doesn''t look like you took too much time to set the shot up - has a candid look (not necessarily a bad thing, especially given that the action is naturally a spontaneous one). I do think a fill flash on your son''s face or directional light highlighting his features would have bumped you up a bit. I also find the gargabe can a little distracting in the front.Overall very cute, though. ', '2007-02-15 20:04:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370878, 465104, 62318, '<td valign="top">I actually "like" the photo, well not the border. I reminds me of a color negative or some type of infrared image. It is striking in that regards. As for the challenge, I think you went with being a little too literal and too blunt. <br/> <br/>Most DPCer''s like emotion, so while this is a bad photo it doesn''t feel like a bad situation. At least that is the only reason I can see why it scored poorly. Nice thought put into this challenge though.</td>', 'I actually "like" the photo, well not the border. I reminds me of a color negative or some type of infrared image. It is striking in that regards. As for the challenge, I think you went with being a little too literal and too blunt.  Most DPCer''s like emotion, so while this is a bad photo it doesn''t feel like a bad situation. At least that is the only reason I can see why it scored poorly. Nice thought put into this challenge though.', '2007-02-15 20:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370888, 465070, 62318, '<td valign="top">A great idea here. I love the details in everything, you seemed really to capitalize on the ickyness. Excellent exposure and sharpness. I think the only thing missing is the current perspective. The composition just seems a little uneven. I am not sure how many shots you took, but I think a different angle might have worked better. Nonetheless it is a great shot for the challenge. I gave it a 6 during voting.</td>', 'A great idea here. I love the details in everything, you seemed really to capitalize on the ickyness. Excellent exposure and sharpness. I think the only thing missing is the current perspective. The composition just seems a little uneven. I am not sure how many shots you took, but I think a different angle might have worked better. Nonetheless it is a great shot for the challenge. I gave it a 6 during voting.', '2007-02-15 20:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3371068, 464052, 50641, '<td valign="top">Oooh, cute!  I  ain''t never hoyd of him, so it''s fun to see.  I like the composition, the way we''re drawn up his arm. Dunno if that''s just how he is or if you made that call, but it''s cool.</td>', 'Oooh, cute!  I  ain''t never hoyd of him, so it''s fun to see.  I like the composition, the way we''re drawn up his arm. Dunno if that''s just how he is or if you made that call, but it''s cool.', '2007-02-15 21:30:19.000000', NULL, 0),
