(3372283, 463356, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image. The elements, alone, night, and blowing snow make it connect with the viewers emotions.  The single light from the right is just perfect for the effect.</td>', 'Very powerful image. The elements, alone, night, and blowing snow make it connect with the viewers emotions.  The single light from the right is just perfect for the effect.', '2007-02-16 10:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3372292, 465104, 66597, '<td valign="top">Leah,<br/>I must be colorblind, because I actually really <i>like</i> the scheme you have going on here. It''s one of those photos that is so over the top it works :-) I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I would have been one of your higher scores if I had. The whole pink&amp;green thing is pretty common down here in SC, where it has a connotation of preppiness. No joke. You''ll have to try harder if you want to really submit something bad :-)</td>', 'Leah,I must be colorblind, because I actually really like the scheme you have going on here. It''s one of those photos that is so over the top it works :-) I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I would have been one of your higher scores if I had. The whole pink&green thing is pretty common down here in SC, where it has a connotation of preppiness. No joke. You''ll have to try harder if you want to really submit something bad :-)', '2007-02-16 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3372301, 465070, 66597, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the most foul toilet in all of Buffalo. Maybe even the entire state of NY, and I imagine you''ve got some pretty stiff competition on that one :-) I do like the comment from Santiago, below. <br/>Definitely not a bad photo (pun intended) of what it is. I don''t get the feeling you were going for something to hang in a museum, though. ''Course maybe MOMA will accept it.</td>', 'This has got to be the most foul toilet in all of Buffalo. Maybe even the entire state of NY, and I imagine you''ve got some pretty stiff competition on that one :-) I do like the comment from Santiago, below. Definitely not a bad photo (pun intended) of what it is. I don''t get the feeling you were going for something to hang in a museum, though. ''Course maybe MOMA will accept it.', '2007-02-16 10:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3372310, 463318, 66597, '<td valign="top">Underrated IMO. I really like the subtle shapes and grays. Sorry I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I would have given you at least a 7. A little more negative space on the left wouldn''t hurt, but then again, nearly the whole photo is negative space. Which I like. Great job.</td>', 'Underrated IMO. I really like the subtle shapes and grays. Sorry I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I would have given you at least a 7. A little more negative space on the left wouldn''t hurt, but then again, nearly the whole photo is negative space. Which I like. Great job.', '2007-02-16 10:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3372314, 464600, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and very nice composition. The title really suits the photo and contest as well. It''s pretty cool how the pieces of mirror made such an intriguing pattern, which you captured well. If there is anything I''d consider changing, it would be a little less saturation. Great photo!</td>', 'Interesting idea and very nice composition. The title really suits the photo and contest as well. It''s pretty cool how the pieces of mirror made such an intriguing pattern, which you captured well. If there is anything I''d consider changing, it would be a little less saturation. Great photo!', '2007-02-16 10:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3373028, 463425, 26045, '<td valign="top">so cool! i think this is a shot to be proud of...it''s clever AND cute!<br/></td>', 'so cool! i think this is a shot to be proud of...it''s clever AND cute!', '2007-02-16 15:48:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3373275, 464663, 30896, '<td valign="top">It does not say "bad" to me, but it is incredibly bright and yes, clean picture, with nice composition, so I voted quite high anyway</td>', 'It does not say "bad" to me, but it is incredibly bright and yes, clean picture, with nice composition, so I voted quite high anyway', '2007-02-16 17:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3374690, 464952, 66597, '<td valign="top">Kelly,<br/>I think this photo has lots of potential. I like the skin tone a lot - think it matches well the mood you are trying to evoke. I also think you chose an excellent background. The slight texture adds depth without stealing the thunder from the subject.<br/>The big issue, as other commenters have mentioned, is the lighting focus. Generally speaking, the eye is immediately drawn to the brightest area of a photo. In this case, it is the forearm rather than the face. Since this is basic, and you couldn''t fix the lighting, I think a closer crop with the eyes in the upper 2/3 position would have helped bump your score up a few notches. <br/>Hope this is helpful!</td>', 'Kelly,I think this photo has lots of potential. I like the skin tone a lot - think it matches well the mood you are trying to evoke. I also think you chose an excellent background. The slight texture adds depth without stealing the thunder from the subject.The big issue, as other commenters have mentioned, is the lighting focus. Generally speaking, the eye is immediately drawn to the brightest area of a photo. In this case, it is the forearm rather than the face. Since this is basic, and you couldn''t fix the lighting, I think a closer crop with the eyes in the upper 2/3 position would have helped bump your score up a few notches. Hope this is helpful!', '2007-02-17 09:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3374760, 463873, 66597, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, so I''m just now seeing this photo for the first time. Looks like a hideous storm! Hope you and your family didn''t end up with lasting damage from it.<br/>As a photo, the composition isn''t bad, and the colors/focus are very sharp. There is something that feels a little "smooshed" about it, but maybe that was your intent? If not, a bit more sky would help open it up IMO. Must have been one cold photo op :-)</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, so I''m just now seeing this photo for the first time. Looks like a hideous storm! Hope you and your family didn''t end up with lasting damage from it.As a photo, the composition isn''t bad, and the colors/focus are very sharp. There is something that feels a little "smooshed" about it, but maybe that was your intent? If not, a bit more sky would help open it up IMO. Must have been one cold photo op :-)', '2007-02-17 09:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3374768, 464964, 66597, '<td valign="top">What a cutie, even if he is being bad :-) <br/>Nice rich colors in this shot, and good sharp focus, which can be difficult indoors. One thing that I think would make a big difference would be use of fill flash on this - full flash would be too much, and most likely blow the colors on his head, but a fill flash focused on his head would nicely highlight, I think.</td>', 'What a cutie, even if he is being bad :-) Nice rich colors in this shot, and good sharp focus, which can be difficult indoors. One thing that I think would make a big difference would be use of fill flash on this - full flash would be too much, and most likely blow the colors on his head, but a fill flash focused on his head would nicely highlight, I think.', '2007-02-17 09:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3374916, 463804, 29949, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by talj:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice idea and I like your composition! Is this MAK helping Team Femme Fatale to beat Team ZOO?? :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>WAHAHA! yes exectly MAK helped me to beat his team ....lol <br/>That is MAK... bless him...</td>', 'Originally posted by talj: Nice idea and I like your composition! Is this MAK helping Team Femme Fatale to beat Team ZOO?? :o)   WAHAHA! yes exectly MAK helped me to beat his team ....lol That is MAK... bless him...', '2007-02-17 10:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
