(3376737, 463221, 60770, '<td valign="top">Great concept for the challenge! I think the image is being dominated by the bright top. A fill light to bring out detail in the sled would have been incredible.</td>', 'Great concept for the challenge! I think the image is being dominated by the bright top. A fill light to bring out detail in the sled would have been incredible.', '2007-02-17 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3378723, 465030, 66597, '<td valign="top">I get a real chuckle out of this, maybe because it reminds me of a lot of guys I knew in high school/college. Not that many women don''t also appreciate classic cars. :-)<br/>Creative take on the challenge, nice sharp focus, nothing wrong with the technicals aside from area of blown lighting, which other commenters have already noted.<br/>That being said, I think this is a photo that appeals mainly to those who appreciate these types of cars - which is reflected in your scores. <br/>If you buy it, enjoy tearing up the Utah roads with this baaaaaad piece of machinery!<br/></td>', 'I get a real chuckle out of this, maybe because it reminds me of a lot of guys I knew in high school/college. Not that many women don''t also appreciate classic cars. :-)Creative take on the challenge, nice sharp focus, nothing wrong with the technicals aside from area of blown lighting, which other commenters have already noted.That being said, I think this is a photo that appeals mainly to those who appreciate these types of cars - which is reflected in your scores. If you buy it, enjoy tearing up the Utah roads with this baaaaaad piece of machinery!', '2007-02-18 19:54:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3378725, 464971, 66597, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge very well, and I think you made a good choice with the b&amp;w treatment. A couple things I might consider would be to include the whole skeleton hand in the frame, and to either remove a couple of the objects (which I can understand you may not want to do) or provide a little more negative space so the eye has more room to move around and take everything in. Very nice job with the pure black background in basic, by the way!</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge very well, and I think you made a good choice with the b&w treatment. A couple things I might consider would be to include the whole skeleton hand in the frame, and to either remove a couple of the objects (which I can understand you may not want to do) or provide a little more negative space so the eye has more room to move around and take everything in. Very nice job with the pure black background in basic, by the way!', '2007-02-18 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
