(3398660, 464972, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think, frustratingly enough, that the most "negative" part of this shot - scorewise - is the woodgrain and the dominance of brown.  I think a black tablecloth and some kind of rug would have kept the exposure under better control and brought my eye more to the desired focal point.  The grain and the light color of the wood makes my eyes wander.  <br/> <br/>The white balance feels a little blue, too.</td>', 'I think, frustratingly enough, that the most "negative" part of this shot - scorewise - is the woodgrain and the dominance of brown.  I think a black tablecloth and some kind of rug would have kept the exposure under better control and brought my eye more to the desired focal point.  The grain and the light color of the wood makes my eyes wander.   The white balance feels a little blue, too.', '2007-02-23 16:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3399618, 464746, 55838, '<td valign="top">A beautifully personal and emotional shot that gives me a glimpse into dealing with asthma.  IMO the best photos of all are the ones that make me feel something, learn something, and/or experience something on a level I never have before.  This shot defintely does that.  Very well composed.  Thank you for investing in it and having the courage to share it.</td>', 'A beautifully personal and emotional shot that gives me a glimpse into dealing with asthma.  IMO the best photos of all are the ones that make me feel something, learn something, and/or experience something on a level I never have before.  This shot defintely does that.  Very well composed.  Thank you for investing in it and having the courage to share it.', '2007-02-23 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
