(3488695, 463274, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I''ve never seen a better photo of a bad night''s sleep. This photo really says it all. He looks like he doesn''t even have the energy to pick up his coffee cup. He got everything ready: the coffee, the newspaper, the glasses, but that was as far as he could get -- the little bit of energy from his night''s rest was already drained.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I''ve never seen a better photo of a bad night''s sleep. This photo really says it all. He looks like he doesn''t even have the energy to pick up his coffee cup. He got everything ready: the coffee, the newspaper, the glasses, but that was as far as he could get -- the little bit of energy from his night''s rest was already drained.', '2007-03-26 11:43:50.000000', NULL, 0),
